# Monetization

- Model: **Free trial + one-time Pro unlock**. Never use subscriptions.
- Pro price target: **$1.99**
- Free version must be limited but still useful
- Pro unlocks unlimited usage plus extras (stats, recurring, multiple lists, etc.)
- Always include a **Restore Purchase** button
- Always handle loading and error states for purchases
- After purchase or restore, **force refresh CustomerInfo** so Pro status updates immediately

Paywall copy must include: **“One-time purchase • No subscription”**

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — refresh entitlement after purchase/restore
final customerInfo = await Purchases.purchasePackage(package);
await Purchases.getCustomerInfo(); // force refresh
ref.invalidate(proStatusProvider);

// ❌ BAD — assume purchase result is enough, or use subscriptions
await Purchases.purchasePackage(package);
```
